{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Quotient"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_append","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_append","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Tw.lean#L126-L135","doc":"**Concatenation is multiplication.** The one structural fact about `wordProduct` that\nholds over the quadratic-only quotient, since it uses no relation at all — only\nassociativity. Everything beyond this needs the braid relations, which this quotient does\nnot impose. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_singleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_singleton","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Tw.lean#L120-L123","doc":"**Singleton word**: the word product of `[s]` is `T_s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_cons","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Tw.lean#L114-L117","doc":"**Cons step**: the word-product on `s :: rest` factors as `T_s · wordProduct rest`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct_nil","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Tw.lean#L110-L111","doc":"**Empty word maps to 1** definitionally. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Tw.wordProduct","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Tw.lean#L98-L107","doc":"**Word product** in `IwahoriHeckeQuot R q S` for an explicit finite list of simple\nreflections: `T_{s_{i_1}} · T_{s_{i_2}} · … · T_{s_{i_k}}`.\n\nThis is honest as stated and nothing more: it is a product of generators in the\nquadratic-only quotient. It is **not** `T_w` — see the scope note in the module docstring,\nand `QOU.IwahoriHecke.BraidWordInvariance` for the word product over the algebra that\nactually imposes the braid relations. ","signatureChunk":0}]}